<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<component type="desktop">
  <id>com.actualbudget.actual</id>
  <name>ActuYNAB</name>
  <summary>Local-first personal finance for shared households</summary>
  <metadata_license>MIT</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <content_rating type="oars-1.0" />
  <description>
    <p>ActuYNAB is a privacy-focused, local-first finance app for shared households. It builds on Actual Budget's envelope budgeting model while keeping data under your control with multi-device sync and optional end-to-end encryption.</p>
    <p>Designed for speed, ActuYNAB minimizes distractions and works without a network connection. It supports household setup, transparent statement review, and deterministic categorization without replacing the underlying accounting model.</p>
    <p>ActuYNAB keeps budgeting grounded in real income and supports transactions, splits, transfers, and reports. Its household extensions remain additive, so account balances and budgeting calculations stay compatible with the upstream engine.</p>
  </description>
